(7055580, 1073280, 94815, '<td valign="top">Fading hard edges approach ambiguity befitting the title. Very Cutout-like.</td>', 'Fading hard edges approach ambiguity befitting the title. Very Cutout-like.', '2013-06-26 16:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055586, 1073577, 94815, '<td valign="top">All light dark fuzzy neary sharp muted color bw with beady eyed focus..</td>', 'All light dark fuzzy neary sharp muted color bw with beady eyed focus..', '2013-06-26 16:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055589, 1073590, 94815, '<td valign="top">Give it time. Good grays.</td>', 'Give it time. Good grays.', '2013-06-26 16:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055591, 1073576, 94815, '<td valign="top">Brain mapping revelations.</td>', 'Brain mapping revelations.', '2013-06-26 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055592, 1073119, 94815, '<td valign="top">Not so fast. Very sensitively judged composition.</td>', 'Not so fast. Very sensitively judged composition.', '2013-06-26 16:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055595, 1073146, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good balance of vague and sharply defined edges and amorphous forms keeps the mix gurgling as we search for resolution.</td>', 'Good balance of vague and sharply defined edges and amorphous forms keeps the mix gurgling as we search for resolution.', '2013-06-26 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055600, 1073489, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think this misses the active ambiguity and/or incisiveness that in various proportions characterizes Cutout. It seems rather to descend more from the esthetic of Vermeer and as such is quite beautifully rendered. The earthy color pallet and soft light match the exceptionally effective omposition that captures and freezes a subtle motion and and conveys the exchange between the child and adult with only what is required to establish size, place and relationship of the elements. I hope this art school verbosity doesn''t come across as too stuffy - I was moved by the image that seemed a nearly revelatory moment in the way it communicates so clearly.</td>', 'I think this misses the active ambiguity and/or incisiveness that in various proportions characterizes Cutout. It seems rather to descend more from the esthetic of Vermeer and as such is quite beautifully rendered. The earthy color pallet and soft light match the exceptionally effective omposition that captures and freezes a subtle motion and and conveys the exchange between the child and adult with only what is required to establish size, place and relationship of the elements. I hope this art school verbosity doesn''t come across as too stuffy - I was moved by the image that seemed a nearly revelatory moment in the way it communicates so clearly.', '2013-06-26 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055605, 1072968, 94815, '<td valign="top">A narrative of A Gordon Pym.. Very Cutout-like.</td>', 'A narrative of A Gordon Pym.. Very Cutout-like.', '2013-06-26 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055606, 1073488, 94815, '<td valign="top">Effectively ambiguous the Cutout way. Looks like a situation where precision would be preferred.</td>', 'Effectively ambiguous the Cutout way. Looks like a situation where precision would be preferred.', '2013-06-26 16:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055611, 1073306, 94815, '<td valign="top">Cat lure. At least it''s a cutout and appropriately vague if unambiguous.</td>', 'Cat lure. At least it''s a cutout and appropriately vague if unambiguous.', '2013-06-26 16:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
