(7059998, 1073306, 53814, '<td valign="top">Jan, my apologies for the feeble attempt, I intended to present a more fitting tribute to your inspirational photography. The head nurse denied my written request for pointed scissors, she only allowed me one pair of plastic safety scissors ("to be used only with attendant supervision") The small finger holes were uncomfortably unmanageable and made "cutting within the lines" impossible. As an additional handicap, she also found, and removed, my stash of Coors beer before I could finish my lighting setup.<br/> <br/>I hope to do better in the "Style of Cutout II" Challenge. (assuming I''m out of here)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Jan, my apologies for the feeble attempt, I intended to present a more fitting tribute to your inspirational photography. The head nurse denied my written request for pointed scissors, she only allowed me one pair of plastic safety scissors ("to be used only with attendant supervision") The small finger holes were uncomfortably unmanageable and made "cutting within the lines" impossible. As an additional handicap, she also found, and removed, my stash of Coors beer before I could finish my lighting setup. I hope to do better in the "Style of Cutout II" Challenge. (assuming I''m out of here) ', '2013-07-03 02:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
