(7060282, 1073306, 53814, '<td valign="top">I am using an old Firefox 3.6 browser. It''s been awhile since I last browsed DPC and am surprised by the changes made to the website code:<br/> <br/>- I can no longer mark my photos as "helpful. <br/> <br/>- I can not browse the challenges (only the top 10 entries show, there is no page navigation showing) <br/> <br/>- The top menu navigation bar displays in the middle of the entries. <br/> <br/>- I can not post in any of the forums.<br/> <br/>Other than that, everything is as it should be...</td>', 'I am using an old Firefox 3.6 browser. It''s been awhile since I last browsed DPC and am surprised by the changes made to the website code: - I can no longer mark my photos as "helpful.  - I can not browse the challenges (only the top 10 entries show, there is no page navigation showing)  - The top menu navigation bar displays in the middle of the entries.  - I can not post in any of the forums. Other than that, everything is as it should be...', '2013-07-03 15:33:59.000000', NULL, 0),
