(7239579, 1073573, 23484, '<td valign="top">The grain really gives this a cool feeling. Love the eyeball.</td>', 'The grain really gives this a cool feeling. Love the eyeball.', '2014-07-10 14:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7239737, 1072914, 43463, '<td valign="top">Blurs have to really have punch and capture my imagination and attention - and this does that. This captures the movement of the dance perfectly that a stock still sharp as a tack one cannot. What I also love is the swirl of bright colors on the woman''s skirt. It is not just movement of the dance, but capture the colorful sensation of the dance.</td>', 'Blurs have to really have punch and capture my imagination and attention - and this does that. This captures the movement of the dance perfectly that a stock still sharp as a tack one cannot. What I also love is the swirl of bright colors on the woman''s skirt. It is not just movement of the dance, but capture the colorful sensation of the dance.', '2014-07-11 00:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599744, 1072869, 61651, '<td valign="top">I''m a little late to the commenting party, but holy cow you sure knocked it out of the park here - congrats!</td>', 'I''m a little late to the commenting party, but holy cow you sure knocked it out of the park here - congrats!', '2018-10-31 00:57:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7600618, 1072869, 173844, '<td valign="top">Picked this off the browse page because Karen recently looked at it.  So thank you Karen exceedingly for lifting the curtain to this wonderful opera.  And thank you John for your lyrical image.  As much for the image as also for explaining how you you went about achieving it, revelatory and inspirational.  And to John (cutout) for the original dream and body of art.  This day is the brighter for it.</td>', 'Picked this off the browse page because Karen recently looked at it.  So thank you Karen exceedingly for lifting the curtain to this wonderful opera.  And thank you John for your lyrical image.  As much for the image as also for explaining how you you went about achieving it, revelatory and inspirational.  And to John (cutout) for the original dream and body of art.  This day is the brighter for it.', '2018-11-04 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
